#     i.e. the compiler's vups/vlda.ups with a runtime s register). Each shift scalar s gets the effective k that reproduces
#     all 32 int8 lanes.
#   decision rule (H_native): take the 64 values b = sb << 2 | 1, sb 0..63, and s = b read as int8 (so b >= 0x80 is negative).
